criteria:
Inclusion criteria:
- Pretherapeutic;
- Operable status;
- Mamma-Ca: All patients who have one receive adjuvant radio (chemo) therapy;
- Fresh tissue surgical material available for scientific study;
- surgical report and written histology findings from the Görlitz Hospital available;
- general condition WHO 0-2;
- Age ≥ 18 years
Exclusion criteria:
- Systemic medical therapy, radiotherapy or chemoradiotherapy;
- Lack of insight or lack of cooperation
